        "speaker_label": "மணி",
        "speaker_label_origin": "source-explicit",
        "source_delimiter": ":-",
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 9,
            "printed_page": 8
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Rani! Do not agree. Even if they torture me! Even if they throw me into the fire and burn me to ashes! Even if they make my corpse a feast for crows and vultures and show you that sight—do not agree to marry this wretch.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "`சண்டாளன்` is rendered as the abusive `wretch`; the immutable Tamil retains the exact printed term."
        ]
      }
    },
